<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 27-30.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 27-30.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for June 27-30. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>		June 27-30     June 26/27</p>
<p>    CZK	 0.43097	    0.43261</p>
<p>    DKK	 2.09984	    2.09993</p>
<p>    FIM	 2.67931	    2.68185</p>
<p>    GBP	23.07974	   23.02102</p>
<p>    HUF	 0.07427	    0.07429</p>
<p>    LTL	 3.4535	     3.45155</p>
<p>    LVL	24.23721	   24.23812</p>
<p>    RUR	 0.0024	     0.00239</p>
<p>    SEK	 1.79819	    1.79477</p>
<p>    UAH	 7.43828	    7.42963</p>
<p>    USD	13.814	     13.8024</p>
<p>    XEU	15.68649	   15.68712</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
